The {{Term/Store|Barbarian Leg Wraps|Barbarian Leg Wraps|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Barbarian Leg Wraps are a piece of [[Armor]] located in [[Qaza Tokki Shrine]] at the center of the [[North Lomei Labyrinth]]. After obtaining them, [[Granté]] will begin selling the piece of Armor for 4,000 [[Rupee]]s. According to their description, the Leg Wraps were worn by the warriors of an ancient warlike tribe from the [[Faron (Region)|Faron]] [[Region]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When worn, they provide [[Link]] with one level of [[Attack Up]]. The Barbarian Leg Wraps can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Barbarian Leg Wraps, alongside the [[Barbarian Helm]] and [[Barbarian Armor]], compose the [[Barbarian Set]]. When each piece of the Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides a [[Charge Atk. Stamina Up]] [[Set Bonus]].

