==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Barbarian Leg Wraps are a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and they are obtained by completing the [[Challenge]] "[[Hair-Width Trial: Expert+]]". They can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

