{{Noncanon|End}}

==Trivia==
* As with other [[Barbarian Set]] pieces, upgrading Barbarian Leg Wraps to level ★★ reduces their [[Sell Price]] by 60 [[Rupee]]s. Level ★★★ Barbarian Leg Wraps sell for the same price as level ★ Barbarian Leg Wraps. No other [[Enhancing|Enhancement]]s in the game decrease the Armor's Sell Price.

